<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Explanation:</strong> Top-level <code>await</code> =
(ES2022) allows using <code>await</code> at the top level of ES modules wit=
hout wrapping in an <code>async</code> function. The module execution pause=
s at the <code>await</code>, and importing modules wait for the exporting m=
odule to fully initialize. This is useful for dynamic configuration loading=
 or database connections at module startup.</p>
