<li>A) Default exports are always tree-shaken; named exports never are</li>
<li>B) Named exports are statically analyzable and enable better tree-shaki=
ng; default exports that export objects can prevent tree-shaking</li>
<li>C) Both enable identical tree-shaking results</li>
<li>D) Only CommonJS modules support tree-shaking</li>
