<li>B) Both APIs reject/error for HTTP error status codes (4xx, 5xx)</li>
<li>C) <code>fetch</code> requires explicit <code>response.ok</code> checki=
ng for HTTP errors; <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> uses separate <code>onload<=
