<li>A) The Mediator directly connects all components for direct communicati=
on</li>
<li>B) The Mediator centralizes inter-component communication =E2=80=94 com=
ponents don't talk to each other directly, reducing coupling</li>
<li>C) The Mediator is identical to the Observer/Pub-Sub pattern</li>
<li>D) The Mediator pattern is only useful for backend systems</li>
