<li>A) <code>IntersectionObserver</code> modifies CSS when elements interse=
ct</li>
<li>B) <code>IntersectionObserver</code> efficiently detects when elements =
enter/exit the viewport without scroll event listeners, enabling lazy loadi=
ng</li>
<li>C) <code>IntersectionObserver</code> is equivalent to <code>getBounding=
