<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Answer: B) <code>Cache-Control</code> headers tell =
browsers and CDNs how long to cache resources, reducing network requests an=
d improving load speed on repeat visits</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Explanation:</strong> <code>Cache-Control: max-age=
