<summary><strong>Answer &amp; Explanation</strong></summary>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Answer: B) <code>defer</code> downloads in parallel=
 and executes in order after HTML parsing; <code>async</code> downloads in =
parallel and executes immediately when ready (order not guaranteed)</strong=
></p>
