 while HTML parses; executes in document order after parsing completes, bef=
ore <code>DOMContentLoaded</code>. Good for scripts that depend on DOM or e=
ach other. <code>async</code>: downloads while HTML parses; executes immedi=
ately when downloaded, interrupting parsing. Order not guaranteed. Good for=
 independent analytics/tracking scripts. Neither blocks HTML parsing during=
 download.</p>
</details>
