<li>A) Push notifications only work when the browser is open</li>
<li>B) The Push API allows servers to send messages to Service Workers even=
 when the app is closed; Notifications API displays the OS-level notificati=
on</li>
<li>C) Push notifications require a native app wrapper</li>
<li>D) Push notifications can only be sent from the same origin</li>
