<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Answer: B) Async test utilities: async/await in tes=
ts, mock timers, waitFor, and test isolation</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Explanation:</strong> Async testing best practices:=
 1) Return Promises or use <code>async/await</code> in test functions. 2) <=
code>jest.useFakeTimers()</code> for testing <code>setTimeout</code>/<code>=
setInterval</code> without actual delays. 3) <code>waitFor(() =3D&gt; expec=
t(...))</code> (Testing Library) for waiting on async UI changes. 4) Mock a=
ll external async dependencies. 5) Ensure cleanup in <code>afterEach</code>=
 to prevent test pollution. Real timers in tests cause flaky, slow test sui=
tes.</p>
