ast resort: log the error with full context. 3) If <code>error.isOperationa=
l</code> (expected error somehow missed) =E2=86=92 log and continue. 4) If =
unknown error type =E2=86=92 it's a bug, crash the process, let the process=
 manager (PM2, systemd, Kubernetes) restart it cleanly.</p>
</details>
