<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Explanation:</strong> State machine approach: <code=
>{ loading: true, data: null, error: null }</code> =E2=86=92 <code>{ loadin=
g: false, data: {...}, error: null }</code> =E2=86=92 <code>{ loading: fals=
e, data: null, error: "Network error" }</code>. These states are mutually e=
xclusive. Components derive behavior from state: show spinner while loading=
