'users'] })</code> to invalidate all user-related queries after mutations; =
use optimistic updates for immediate UI feedback</li>
<li>C) Always set <code>staleTime: Infinity</code> to prevent any automatic=
 refetching</li>
<li>D) Manually call <code>refetch()</code> on every query after every muta=
tion</li>
</ul>
<details>
