<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Answer: B) Hierarchical query keys + <code>invalida=
teQueries</code> for cascading invalidation + optimistic updates</strong></=
p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Explanation:</strong> TanStack Query cache key hier=
archy: <code>['users']</code> is a parent of <code>['users', userId]</code>=
